<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Mas Holdings cautions on year results.</title>
<headline>Mas Holdings cautions on year results.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mail order and direct selling group Mas Holdings said on Friday it expected to record an attributable loss for the second six months of the year and warned shareholders to exercise caution in share dealings.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom 27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
